  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "* Deprecated Windows File Permission extensions\n* Updated internal Polyfill version from 9.7.7 to 9.8.1\n* Improved reliability of Safe IO Enumeration extension methods on .NET Standard 2.0\n* Added Safe Logical Drive Enumeration DriveInfo static extension member methods SafelyEnumerateLogicalDrives and SafelyGetLogicalDrives\n* Added ``DriveInfo`` GetRandomDrive`` static extension method\n* Added ``DirectoryInfo`` ``GetRandomDirectory(bool)`` static extension method for getting a random directory (optional bool parameter determines whether the randomly selected directory must contain files)\n* Added ``FileInfo`` ``GetRandomFile(bool)`` - static extension method for getting a random file\n* Added ``Path`` ``GetRandomFilePath`` - static extension method which returns the ``FileInfo`` static extension method's ``FullName`` property\n* Added ``DirectoryInfo`` static extension property ``HasFiles`` - A better way to detect if a directory has any files within it than the previously introduced ``IsEmpty`` static extension property. ``IsEmpty`` checks for both files and sub directories whereas ``HasFiles`` just looks for files.",
